    skos:definition '"Number concentration" means the number of particles or other specified objects per unit volume. The phrase "stratiform_liquid_water_cloud_top" refers to the top of the highest stratiform liquid water cloud. In an atmosphere model, stratiform cloud is that produced by large-scale convergence (not the convection schemes).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P07::IDWENXCE'^^xsd:string .
