    skos:prefLabel 'atmosphere_mass_content_of_cfc11'@en ;
    skos:definition '"Content" indicates a quantity per unit area. The "atmosphere content" of a quantity refers to the vertical integral from the surface to the top of the atmosphere. For the content between specified levels in the atmosphere, standard names including "content_of_atmosphere_layer" are used. The mass is the total mass of the molecules. The chemical formula of CFC11 is CFCl3. The IUPAC name for CFC11 is trichloro(fluoro)methane.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P07::CF12N26'^^xsd:string .
